{"availability":"available","full":"dkautomation23/llm-doc-extractor","name":"llm-doc-extractor","description":"Schema-driven document -> structured JSON. Anthropic / OpenAI / local Ollama, plus a no-API-key demo mode. Invoices, contracts, emails -> clean data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T12:22:46Z","updated":"2026-10-15T18:46:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dkautomation23.github.io","topics":["anthropic","data-extraction","document-parsing","document-processing","invoice-extraction","json-schema","llm","ollama","openai","python","structured-data","structured-output"],"demo":"https://dkautomation23.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:17.623Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:17.623Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:17.623Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:22.073Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:27.757Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:59:17.623Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn messy documents — invoices, contracts, emails, forms — into clean, schema-shaped JSON you can drop straight into a database, spreadsheet, or CRM.","You describe the fields you want once, in YAML. The tool asks an LLM to fill them in and returns exactly those keys, every time. Swap between Anthropic, OpenAI, or a local Ollama model with one flag, and use the built-in demo provider to run the whole pipeline with no API key at all.","Most \"AI document\" work is the same loop: read a PDF/email, find a handful of fields, write them somewhere structured. This is that loop, made repeatable and provider-agnostic — so you're not locked to one vendor and you can test offline."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dkautomation23/llm-doc-extractor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d3ffab96c01c871ac9315f651d5db692c57a226ef715a755856b394b3deb8269","extracte